Z||000017||avengador1||12-29-2001||05:10 PM||||The tranny is gated so you wont shift more than one gear at a time and blow it up.Its a copy of the old Mercedes type auto trans shifter. As for the pictures above, I don't know why the seats look brown(purple?), they actually are black. And as to the performance, I won't be able to tell till it's broken in at 1000 miles or 5 to 6 weeks from now. The handling is excellent tho. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 12-29-2001).]||||reg||1
